t to use xclip for text clipboard copy and paste, with only a normal package-install note as elevated access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill targets Linux environments with xclip and does not request network access, credential stores, background workers, broad indexing, or unrelated local access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation uses the system package manager via sudo dnf install xclip, which requires elevated privileges but is disclosed and proportionate for installing a missing OS clipboard utility.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The runtime instructions are narrow and task-focused; the CLAUDE.md file contains only a recent-activity memory note and no behavioral override, hidden instruction, or unrelated authority.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installing xclip persists as a normal system package, but the skill does not install services, hooks, scheduled tasks, or any autonomous persistence.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is text-only clipboard interaction, and the artifact only provides xclip commands for copying text, reading clipboard text, and copying file contents to the clipboard.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this only if you are comfortable allowing an agent to read and write your text clipboard when you invoke the skill. Clipboard contents and copied file contents can contain sensitive data, so review what is being copied or pasted; the sudo command should only be used if you trust installing xclip from your configured dnf repositories.","findings":"[PE2] expected: The sudo finding is tied only to the disclosed dnf package installation command for xclip; it is elevated access, but it is user-visible and expected for installing a system dependency.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789031028601}}}}}